  "outlook_text": "To mitigate the impact of lower demand, we expanded our cost reduction initiatives and expect these new measures, combined with earlier actions, to now generate $40 to $45 million in realized cost savings in 2020.  While we expect demand to trough in the second quarter, ... Global demand trends weakened significantly in April, declining in the low 40% range versus the prior year.",
